# SKULBUY PLATFORM UPGRADE 2.0
## Onboarding, University Discovery, ₦500 Signup Bonus, Product Uploads, Campus Meetups and Skully AI Assistant

**Role:** Act as a senior full-stack engineer, product designer, UX strategist and AI integration specialist.

You are working on the existing SkulBuy application. Your task is to implement the following improvements directly into the current application, preserving all working features and existing integrations.

This is an enhancement of the existing product, not a request to build another application.

The overall vision is to position SkulBuy as a Nigerian university marketplace where students can buy, sell and rent products across universities, discover opportunities, connect with other students and participate in campus activities.

